# Persian additive clock quarter: "ساعت سه و ربع" == three-and-a-quarter ==
# 03:15, the quarter counted PAST the named hour (not toward the next one).
# Citation 1: UT Austin, Persian Online Resources, "To Tell the Time" --
# "ساعت یک و ربع است" (sa'at yek-o rob' ast) == "It is one-fifteen."
# https://sites.la.utexas.edu/persian_online_resources/numbers-1/to-tell-the-time/
# Citation 2: talkpal.ai, "Telling Time in Persian Language" -- "3:15 -
# ساعت سه و ربع (sa'at-e seh va rob')".
# https://talkpal.ai/vocabulary/telling-time-in-persian-language/
ربع
